@Drive_Car_Solutions_API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5266

### 1. Create a Customer
POST {{Drive_Car_Solutions_API_HostAddress}}/api/customers/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "phone": "+1-555-012-3456",
  "address": "123 Main Street, Cityville, State 12345"
}

### 2. Create a Vehicle
POST {{Drive_Car_Solutions_API_HostAddress}}/api/vehicles/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "carName": "Toyota Camry",
  "plateNumber": "ABC-1234",
  "model": "2023 LE",
  "customerId": 1
}

### 3. Create a Service Type (Optional, as you seeded 6 already)
POST {{Drive_Car_Solutions_API_HostAddress}}/api/servicetypes/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceName": "Full Detailing"
}

### 4. Create a Vehicle Service Record
POST {{Drive_Car_Solutions_API_HostAddress}}/api/vehicleservices/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "serviceTypeId": 1,
  "serviceDate": "2026-05-18T10:30:00Z",
  "price": 49.99
}
